localsyz -- find syzygies
*************************

  * Usage: 
        localsyz m
  * Inputs:
      * m, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, giving minimal generators of the
        syzygies taking into account the local structure

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = ZZ/32003[x,y,z,w,SkewCommutative=>true]   |
|                                                   |
|o1 = R                                             |
|                                                   |
|o1 : PolynomialRing, 4 skew commutative variable(s)|
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : m = matrix{{x,y*z},{z*w,x}}                   |
|                                                   |
|o2 = | x  yz |                                     |
|     | zw x  |                                     |
|                                                   |
|             2      2                              |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R                               |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : setMaxIdeal(ideal(x,y,z,w))                   |
|                                                   |
|o3 = ideal (x, y, z, w)                            |
|                                                   |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                    |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : localsyz m                                    |
|                                                   |
|o4 = {2} | -yz -x |                                |
|     {2} | x   zw |                                |
|                                                   |
|             2      2                              |
|o4 : Matrix R  <-- R                               |
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : m * localsyz m                                |
|                                                   |
|o5 = 0                                             |
|                                                   |
|             2      2                              |
|o5 : Matrix R  <-- R                               |
+---------------------------------------------------+

