    methods
  * *note localComplement: localComplement, -- find the splitting of the target
    of a map
  * *note localsyz: localsyz, -- find syzygies
  * *note localMingens: localMingens, -- finds a minimal set of generators
  * *note localModulo: localModulo, -- find the pre-image (pullback) of image
